---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Header from '../../components/Header.astro'; import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro'; import { resources } from '../../data/resources';
---
<BaseLayout title="E-Ticaret, SEO ve AI Arama Rehberleri | QCT Commerce" description="E-ticaret maliyeti, pazaryeri komisyonları, web sitesi yatırımı, SEO ve AI arama görünürlüğü için uygulamaya dönük rehberler." lang="tr" breadcrumbs={[{name:'Ana sayfa',url:'/'},{name:'Rehberler',url:'/rehberler/'}]}>
<Header slot="header" lang="tr" /><main class="hub"><header class="hub__hero container"><p>QCT COMMERCE KAYNAKLARI</p><h1>E-Ticaret ve SEO Rehberleri</h1><div>E-ticaret altyapısı, pazaryeri maliyetleri, web yatırımı ve arama görünürlüğü için gerçek kullanım sorularından yola çıkan kaynaklar.</div></header><section class="container"><div class="hub__grid">{resources.map((resource) => <a href={`/rehberler/${resource.slug}/`}><span>REHBER</span><h2>{resource.title}</h2><p>{resource.description}</p><b>Oku →</b></a>)}</div></section><section class="hub__tools"><div class="container"><p>ÜCRETSİZ ARAÇLAR</p><h2>Maliyeti varsaymak yerine hesaplayın.</h2><nav><a href="/tr/araclar/pazaryeri-komisyon-hesaplama/">Pazaryeri komisyon hesaplayıcı →</a><a href="/tr/araclar/web-sitesi-fiyat-hesaplama/">Web sitesi fiyat hesaplayıcı →</a><a href="/tr/araclar/e-ticaret-maliyet-hesaplama/">E-ticaret maliyet hesaplayıcı →</a></nav></div></section></main><Footer slot="footer" lang="tr" />
</BaseLayout>
<style>.hub{background:var(--qct-color-background)}.hub__hero{padding:calc(var(--qct-hero-clearance) + 65px) 20px 72px;text-align:center}.hub__hero>p,.hub__tools p{color:var(--qct-color-accent-strong);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em}.hub h1,.hub h2{color:var(--qct-color-ink);letter-spacing:-.055em;text-wrap:balance}.hub h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.5vw,4.5rem);line-height:1.02;margin:0 auto 1.3rem;max-width:18ch}.hub__hero div{color:var(--qct-color-muted);line-height:1.72;margin:auto;max-width:700px}.hub__grid{display:grid;gap:14px;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));padding-bottom:80px}.hub__grid a{border:1px solid var(--qct-color-line-strong);color:inherit;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:225px;padding:22px;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s}.hub__grid a:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}.hub__grid span{color:var(--qct-color-accent-strong);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}.hub__grid h2{font-size:1.35rem;line-height:1.15;margin:.8rem 0}.hub__grid p{color:var(--qct-color-muted);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.55;margin:0}.hub__grid b{color:var(--qct-color-ink);margin-top:auto;padding-top:1.4rem}.hub__tools{background:#171412;color:#fffaf5;padding:65px 0}.hub__tools h2{color:#fffaf5;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);margin:.4rem 0 1.5rem}.hub__tools nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}.hub__tools a{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);color:#fffaf5;padding:.9rem 1rem;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:850px){.hub__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:560px){.hub__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hub__grid a{min-height:0}}</style>
